          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: भय",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भय — bhay — \"dread; fear\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बच्चों को साँप से बहुत भय लगता है। baccoṁ ko sā̃p se bahut bhay lagtā hai. Children are terribly afraid of snakes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भय (bhay) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit bhaya, \"fear, alarm, dread\" (Monier-Williams). It is more formal than ḍar."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
