          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घबराना (ghabrānā) is probably inherited: CDIAL lists Hindi ghābrā, \"startled\", under ghabbhara, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 4427), and ghabrānā belongs with it. ghabrāhaṭ, \"nervousness\", is its noun."
