              "text": "डराना — ḍarānā — \"to frighten\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरुण ने कहानी सुनाकर छोटे भाई को डराया। Aruṇ ne kahānī sunākar choṭe bhāī ko ḍarāyā. Arun frightened his little brother with a story."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने भाई को डराया, usne bhāī ko ḍarāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
