          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डराना (ḍarānā) is the causative partner of ḍarnā, \"to be afraid\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit darati, \"fears\" (CDIAL 6190): to make someone afraid."
            }
